<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>ElevenLabs has set a new standard for AI-generated speech. With remarkably natural-sounding voices, advanced emotion control, and industry-leading voice cloning capabilities, it's become the go-to platform for creators, developers, and businesses needing high-quality synthetic speech.</p>
<p>What makes ElevenLabs exceptional is the sheer quality of its voice generation. Unlike robotic-sounding TTS systems of the past, ElevenLabs produces speech that's virtually indistinguishable from human recordings. The platform supports 29 languages, offers instant voice cloning from just a few minutes of audio, and provides granular control over speaking style, emotion, and pacing.</p>
<p>From audiobook narration to video voiceovers, from AI assistants to accessibility tools, ElevenLabs powers millions of voice applications. Its combination of quality, flexibility, and developer-friendly API has made it the leading choice in the AI voice generation space.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="23" y2="23"></line></svg></div>
<h4>Voice Cloning</h4>
<p>Clone any voice with just 1 minute of audio. Professional cloning with 3+ hours of data for maximum accuracy.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🌍</div>
<h4>Multilingual Support</h4>
<p>Generate speech in 29 languages with native accents. Seamlessly switch between languages in single projects.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🎭</div>
<h4>Emotion &amp; Style Control</h4>
<p>Adjust emotion, pace, and delivery style. Create anything from calm narration to energetic presentations.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
<h4>Turbo v2.5 Model</h4>
<p>Lightning-fast generation with ultra-low latency. Perfect for real-time applications and conversational AI.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div>
<h4>Voice Library</h4>
<p>Access 1000+ pre-made voices across different ages, accents, and styles. Community-created voices available.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg></div>
