<h3>Additional Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Voice Design:</strong> Create unique voices from scratch by blending characteristics and attributes</li>
<li><strong>Speech to Speech:</strong> Convert your voice to any other voice in real-time while preserving emotion</li>
<li><strong>Sound Effects:</strong> Generate custom sound effects and audio from text descriptions</li>
<li><strong>Audio Native:</strong> Create dynamic, interactive audio content that adapts to listener preferences</li>
<li><strong>Pronunciation Library:</strong> Save custom pronunciations for names, brands, and technical terms</li>
<li><strong>Commercial Rights:</strong> Full commercial usage rights included in paid plans</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Best-in-class voice quality and realism</li>
<li>Incredibly natural emotion and intonation</li>
<li>Fast voice cloning from minimal audio</li>
<li>29 languages with native accents</li>
<li>Turbo model for real-time applications</li>
<li>Powerful API with great documentation</li>
<li>Video dubbing in multiple languages</li>
<li>Active development and improvements</li>
<li>Commercial usage rights included</li>
<li>Large community voice library</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Can be expensive for heavy usage</li>
<li>Free tier very limited (10k characters/month)</li>
<li>Voice cloning requires ethical approval</li>
<li>No mobile app for voice generation</li>
<li>Character limits on all paid plans</li>
<li>Learning curve for advanced features</li>
<li>API pricing separate from subscription</li>
<li>Occasional pronunciation quirks</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
